      "notes": "excludedSets (LEGAL-C07, RJ-confirmed 2026-11-25): the promo groupings OPP, JDG and PR are not legal as sets, so a printing in them never makes a card legal on its own. Promos are legal by name: a promo printing of a card whose name has a printing in a legal set is legal, because legality is keyed by cardKey. A card whose only printings are in OPP / JDG / PR fails LEGAL-017. Every legalUntil is null: Riot says the first rotation is at the start of 2028 (Sets 1-5) but publishes no per-set date (LEGAL-C05). OGN-VEN have no Riot-published legalFrom (LEGAL-C08). 2v2 is not listed: it is data only in banlist.json (LEGAL-B11) and no 2v2 deck rules are specified."
